    "detailed_description": "<strong>Silent Harbor</strong>- is a first-person horror adventure game that will immerse you in a creepy story.<br>You have to go in search of your missing wife, who sailed away on an expedition and never returned.<br>You in the role of Carl Jones go in search of her.<br>On the way you are enveloped in thick fog,<br>and in the distance a bell is heard, and a small fishing village begins to be seen.<br>Since Karl is very tired on the way, he decides to stay in the village until the morning.<br><br><strong>Game Play</strong><br>Collect evidence.<br>Chat with the villagers to find out more information.<br>Solve riddles and puzzles<br>Explore the village<br>Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of this place<br>Each new launch of the game will not be the same<br>The game will be unique for each player<br><strong>Silent Harbor</strong> - has multiple endings",
